---
name: Normalize Claude Code OTLP to OCSF
description: >
  Subscribes to native OTLP events, normalizes Claude Code logs and traces, and
  publishes OCSF events to the `ocsf` topic.
disabled: true
restart-on-error: 1m
---

subscribe "otlp"
anthropic::claude_code::ocsf
ocsf_derive
ocsf_cast
publish "ocsf"
